# duck_wiki.sit - The Duck Wiki
T:=== DUCKS ===
T:------------
T:1. OVERVIEW
T:Ducks are
T:waterfowl.
T:Family:
T:Anatidae.
T:
T:2. HABITAT
T:Found in
T:ponds, lakes,
T:rivers, and
T:wetlands.
T:
T:They live on
T:every land
T:continent
T:except
T:Antarctica.
T:
T:3. ANATOMY
T:Feathers are
T:waterproof.
T:
T:Preen gland
T:produces oil
T:to repel
T:water.
T:
T:Webbed feet
T:act like
T:paddles.
T:
T:Bills have
T:comb-like
T:pecten to
T:filter food.
T:
T:4. DIET
T:Omnivores!
T:They eat:
T:- Grass
T:- Aquatic
T:  plants
T:- Small fish
T:- Insects
T:- Snails
T:- Worms
T:
T:5. SPECIES
T:Mallard
T:Canvasback
T:Wood Duck
T:Teal
T:Pintail
T:Eider
T:Mandarin
T:
T:6. SOUNDS
T:Not all
T:ducks quack!
T:Whistle,
T:grunt, or
T:yodel.
T:
T:7. BREEDING
T:Lay eggs in
T:nest lined
T:with down.
T:
T:Ducklings
T:can swim
T:on day one!
T:
T:8. FUN FACTS
T:Duck eyes see
T:in color.
T:
T:Field of
T:view is
T:nearly 360.
T:
